menu "Project DS18B20 Configuration"

    config PROJ_DS18B20_GPIO
        int "DS18B20 1-Wire bus GPIO"
        default 4
        help
            GPIO connected to the DS18B20 data line. GPIO4 is commonly
            free on both ESP32 and ESP32-C3 boards, but - as with
            PROJ_BLINK_GPIO - check your specific board's pinout and
            strapping-pin list before relying on the default.

    config PROJ_DS18B20_MAX_DEVICES
        int "Maximum DS18B20 devices per bus"
        default 4
        help
            Upper bound on how many DS18B20 devices proj_ds18b20_init()
            will enumerate on a single bus.

endmenu
